d['assignment']='O’Connor is selected within the minimum-plus-one pool. Her actual Ornelas opinion supplies the independent legal review applied here, and her actual Houghton opinion defines the object-based search rule whose limited reach must be kept separate from personal arrest probability. The central assignment task is to explain the independent common-possession inference without allowing that earlier search rule to presume passenger guilt. Stevens, at two leads, is the strongest lower-count alternative: his actual Houghton dissent states the personal-connection concern, and the final reconciliation establishes his full join to this different factual application. O’Connor’s demonstrated responsibility for both governing distinctions provides the specific legal fit supporting selection at three rather than Stevens at two. All nine remain eligible; this selection changes no commitment and assumes no persuasive draft process. No separate writing is required to preserve Scalia’s unchanged Ornelas reservation because the opinion applies existing review law without adding a review holding.'
d['form']='Before assignment or counts, form is one signed plenary opinion with a personal-probability rule and this complete application, followed by the bounded derivative remedy. The final additive reconciliation supplies all eight Associate full joins to P1–P3; the Chief’s approved full core produces nine complete joins. The ordinary differences in emphasis and Scalia’s existing review reservation create no separate-writing function. The opinion needs no split lead or judgment-only classification.'
d['reach']='The legal question is personal probable cause at arrest and its consequence for arrest-based suppression. The lawful vehicle-search issue is outside the grant. Concealment, actual accessibility and contemporaneous knowledge remain distinct. The Chief’s expressly preserved independent confession boundary supplies no new claim or waiver adjudication; any independently preserved issue retains only its actual posture. The disputed release-promise account is not a judicial finding.'
d['stone_test']+=' Final compatibility was renewed against the complete additive Houghton model and reconciliation. The three provisional Associate affirmances were expressly tested and restored to reversal in reconciliation on their own verified positions; the Chief’s core supplies no part of that historical correction. The final independent factual inference, with concealed drugs and the innocent-passenger possibility confronted, matches his supported common-possession ground. His independent-confession boundary is preserved by ordinary further proceedings and the limited arrest-based holding, without manufacturing an unresolved claim.'
d['continuity']='The arrest-based exclusion ground is removed and the Maryland courts conduct ordinary further proceedings on the judgment in its proper posture. The rule permits personal probable cause from the supported contemporaneous common-possession combination, with no passenger presumption, silence-based guilt inference or use of later confession facts. Actual Houghton’s search rule and the personal-connection dissent retain their respective force. The additive historical comparison restores Stevens, Souter and Ginsburg’s full P1–P3 joins because their individualized-suspicion objection already substantially existed when they historically accepted this same factual application. Its genuine rationale departure is separately identified in the faithfully copied additive reconciliation: historical Houghton’s generalized passenger/common-enterprise rationale is unavailable here, so all eight Associates require the independent combined-facts explanation. No changed historical judgment or new separate writing follows.'
d['stage_status']='The original frozen all-eight reversal map was followed by a clean additive Houghton model screen proposing affirmance for Stevens, Souter and Ginsburg, then the fresh additive reconciliation restoring their full P1–P3 reversal joins after complete historical Houghton verification. The additive model and reconciliation, not the earlier draft’s coincident tally, establish the final process and grounds. The final current-law model receipt retains the provisional three affirmances only pending that separate reconciliation; the final current-law reconciliation confirms the restored map without an additional ground change.'
d['law_screen']='The complete actual Houghton supplement controls its detached-container rule and pre-search ownership chronology. The final additive reconciliation supplies an independently supported arrest inference instead of historical Houghton’s broader passenger observation. The actual McConnell public holdings and final Greenville/Virginia completeness copies produce no additional effect under both final public-law receipts. The completed December 11 Deaton public opinion was screened before this final assembly: its delegated CWA coverage, navigable-channel protection, preserved Manual interpretation and bounded restoration remedy change no element of knowing possession, personal probable cause, suppression consequence or preserved judicial-record fact. No affected criminal-procedure premise requires a new model stage. Castro’s same-date warning-rule decision supplies no entering law here; its prior creation counts only for authorship.'
d['affected_later']='This screen followed fixation of Pringle’s final P1–P3 grounds and joins. None of the five completed later decisions rests on a passenger-guilt presumption or an inference of shared possession: Rancho Viejo sustains the taking prohibition for the enacted wildlife-taking class as an integral, reasonably adapted part of the Endangered Species Act’s valid interstate scheme; Lomont requires concrete official injury and actual unconditional refusal; Environmental Defense Center retains its operational permit alternative and independently justified information duties; ACLU of New Jersey requires actual custody-and-records delegation, separate APA grounds and a covered-information conflict; West Virginia v. HHS examines its enacted recovery condition and the genuine practical choice under an actual funding consequence. Pringle’s cumulative criminal-probability application neither supplies facts in those records nor lowers their respective source, support, fit or practical-operation requirements. No necessary later premise, disposition or mandate is displaced, and no completed Record is reopened. The later public decisions served only this consequence screen, never present merits law.'
d['sources']+=' The original frozen audit handoffs, complete additive Houghton model and reconciliation, final public-law model and reconciliation, and additive source validation are copied below without substantive editing. The final reconciliation’s restored three joins and genuine rationale departure are preserved as reasoned process evidence.'
d['public']['Opinion Topology']="O'CONNOR, J., delivered the opinion of the Court, in which STONE-ZSELA, C. J., and STEVENS, SCALIA, KENNEDY, SOUTER, THOMAS, GINSBURG, and BREYER, JJ., joined.\n\nThe Court’s opinion has complete joins from all nine Justices on the rule, application and bounded remand."
d['public']['Judgment & Remedy']="**Reversed and remanded, 9–0.**\n\n**Supporting:** Stone-Zsela, Stevens, O'Connor, Scalia, Kennedy, Souter, Thomas, Ginsburg and Breyer.\n\nThe Maryland Court of Appeals’ arrest-based suppression judgment is reversed. The lawful arrest supplies no ground to exclude the ensuing confession as the product of an unlawful seizure. The case returns for ordinary further proceedings on any independently preserved issue before the conviction’s ultimate status is settled."
